# T4.2 case 5: `--connect-all` at startup with the SQL Server container
# stopped. Both connects are started once the first frame is up, so the help
# overlay opening before `wait busy` is the app answering a key while they run.
key ?
expect ╭ Help
key Esc
expect-not ╭ Help

wait busy
expect 1 local-mssql ✗  2 local-oracle ●
frame connect-all
key 1
expect cannot connect
expect c to retry
frame connect-all-failed-tab
key 2
expect-not c to retry
frame connect-all-live-tab
key q
